    "heading": "Level 2: Wild Companion",
    "lineStart": 2888,
    "lineEnd": 2892
  },
  "section": "3.87",
  "rulesText": "You can summon a nature spirit that assumes an animal form to aid you. As a Magic action, you can expend a spell slot or a use of Wild Shape to cast the Find Familiar spell without Material components.\n\nWhen you cast the spell in this way, the familiar is Fey and disappears when you finish a Long Rest."
}
